{"k":"note","text":"continuous `auto` candidate-walk golden: scene_hot_loop(3) recorded THREE times — `df_invocation` passes armed on span 0x100000, then 0x100000, then 0x110000. Every pass restarts at step 0 and carries ONE `rbase`, which is how the producer emits a multi-region capture (one region per invocation, never several inside one pass). The walk re-arms on the first span before moving on, so pass->region is NOT a rotation. A reader showing only the latest pass shows only the LAST region."}
